  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "キャップを　かぶった　ピカチュウの\n１０まんボルトを　Ｚワザに　かえる\nＺパワーの　けっしょうを　つくりだす。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "모자를 쓴 피카츄의\n10만볼트를 Z기술로 바꾸는\nZ파워의 결정을 만들어 낸다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "會製造出把戴著帽子的皮卡丘的十萬伏特\n升級為特殊Ｚ招式的Ｚ力量結晶。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permet de concentrer la Force Z en un cristal,\nqui autorise le Pikachu à casquette qui le tient\nà transformer son Tonnerre en capacité Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Kristallisierte Z-Kraft, die die Attacke Donnerblitz\ndes Pikachus mit Kappe zu einer Z-Attacke\naufstuft. Wird bei Bedarf automatisch vervielfacht.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Concentra el Poder Z en cristales que permiten a\nlos Pikachu que llevan gorra convertir su Rayo en\nun movimiento Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Permette di creare cristalli carichi di Potere Z che\nconsentono a Pikachu con il berretto di trasformare\nla mossa Fulmine in una mossa Z.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "It converts Z-Power into crystals that upgrade\na Thunderbolt by Pikachu in a cap to an\nexclusive Z-Move.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "キャップを　かぶった　ピカチュウの\n１０まんボルトを　Ｚワザに　変える\nＺパワーの　結晶を　作りだす。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "ultra-sun-ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/18/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
